'''Uberfest''' (超ネコ祭 Chō neko-sai, '''Ultra Cat Festival''') is one of the [[:Category:Gacha Event|Gacha events]] in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 3.6 Update|version 3.6]]. This event includes all [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] from every common pool and [[Baby Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|an exclusive character]]. [[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|The second exclusive cat]] was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|version 5.8]] [[D'artanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|The third exclusive cat]] was added in [[Version 6.7 Update|version 6.7]].

